; PMTiles v3, read and extract. Written here rather than taken from the Go
; tool because the desktop build ships as one static binary, and the Phase 6
; region downloader has to run inside it.
;
; Byte reads are injected, so the same code reads a local archive and a remote
; one over HTTP range requests.
(library
 (name pmtiles)
 (libraries decompress.de decompress.gz bigstringaf))
